{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1131471-forum-based-pbp-for-beast-vampire-and-mage-players-wanted","id":1131471,"title":"Forum-based PbP for Beast, Vampire and Mage - Players wanted!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-19T15:23:35-07:00","id":1131471,"title":"Forum-based PbP for Beast, Vampire and Mage - Players wanted!","content":"Hello everyone!<br /> I would like to advertise a online PbP Forum-based Chronicle a bit, in the hopes some of you are looking to play just that kind of game.<br /> Might I introduce <a href=\"http://cedarcitytest2.icyboards.net/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">Cedar City</a>, a place where the Supernatural communities need to work closely together after a catastrophic cataclysm caused by the Wise, which blasted away their leadership - and uncovered the Splats' existences to each other.<br /> The Beast's find themselves faced with an unknown Apex and a Maze of mirroring, distorting glass all throughout the Hive. The Pentacle tries to get the shards back together and rebuild.<br /> The Vampires keep to themselves for now, trying to figure out whether these other beings are pawns or foes, or both.<br /> Each has their own troubles, and goals, but sometimes they intersect and need to rely on one another - whether they trust each other or not.<br /> And then, there is the question of just what has been closing and opening Hedge Gates seemingly at random lately, what is it they try to achieve by doing that, and how can they be stopped?<br /> <br /> The Forum offers Venues for Vampires, Mages and Beasts (Changelings will become a full Venue once 2ed is out, Demons may or may not join at some point in the far future), as well as the possibility for those to interact. Other than normal plotlines, players can also take part in purely social events, or take the time to flesh out their character and their day-to-day life in a glimpse.<br /> House Rules, Homebrew (such as many an Atavism from this very website) and short summaries of what had happened so far and general information on the setting can be found on the page.<br /> <br /> Come in, take a look, read around, decide for yourself whether this is a setting you find yourself wanting to join. We'd be glad to have you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-31T06:34:48-08:00","id":1181112,"title":"","content":"Update:<br /> <br /> Always looking for more players (especially the kind that creates a character and stays for at least a few posts rather than creating a character and disappearing without a word). And good news for those of you inclined towards the Descent- the Demon venue is up and running!<br /> <br /> Those who are afraid that by joining now they'd have a significant xp disadvantage: fret not, your plotlines will be made for you and thus should prove neither too easy nor too challenging + there will be starting xp to level the field a bit.<br /> <br /> <br /> If you have any questions, feel free to ask <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8122-archonares\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8122\" data-vbnamecard=\"8122\">ArchonAres</a> or me =)<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I think the time span passed justifies a doublepost here.<br /> Necroing to avoid opening another thread for the very same purpose.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":